OL,3,GNEWSACourt backs Scottish government
OL,4,Aappeal over Sturgeon inquiry evidence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA court has upheld a Scottish
OL,7,Fgovernment appeal in a row over
OL,8,Fdocuments related to an inquiry into
OL,9,FNicola Sturgeon's handling of the Alex
OL,10,FSalmond affair.
OL,12,FThe Scottish Information Commissioner
OL,13,Fhad ordered ministers to publish papers
OL,14,Ffrom the Hamilton Inquiry ` the
OL,15,Finvestigation into whether then first
OL,16,Fminister Sturgeon had misled MSPs over
OL,17,Fthe probe into claims against her
OL,18,Fpredecessor.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
