OL,3,GNEWSACourt backs Scottish government
OL,4,Aappeal over Sturgeon inquiry evidence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government insisted that
OL,7,Fdoing so would breach court orders
OL,8,Fguaranteeing the anonymity of women who
OL,9,Flodged complaints against Salmond.
OL,11,FThe Court of Session backed the
OL,12,Fministers' appeal, ruling Information
OL,13,FCommissioner David Hamilton had erred
OL,14,Fin law.
